WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,720
Is there anything good going on?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,400
Brother Jin was promoted yesterday

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,530
Congratulations on changing from project leader to deputy minister

4
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:21,920
This is sold for 22 square meters. I will slowly get used to it.

5
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,030
I'm going out to discuss some business

6
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,190
Keep an eye on the fish

7
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,550
Don't let him run out and cause trouble.

8
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:28,550
Stuff him with potato chips

9
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:29,510
Basically honest

10
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:30,950
Oh good

11
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:41,880
Is your boss here?
